  "structuring": {
    "prompt_variant": null,
    "prompt_additions": "Jordan uses ARTICLE as the basic unit (not SECTION). The hierarchy is CHAPTER (bab) > ARTICLE (madda). Paragraphs within articles are lettered (a), (b), (c). Items within paragraphs are numbered (1), (2), (3). Many short laws have no chapters — articles only. The Bluebell keyword ARTICLE maps to AKN <article> element. All content is in Arabic (right-to-left)."
  },
